{'symbol': 'KR', 'date': '2022-06-16 16:01:00', 'title': 'UNIQUE LOGISTICS INTERNATIONAL ADDS THE KROGER COMPANY AS NEW CUSTOMER', 'text': 'NEW YORK , JUNE 16, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- UNIQUE LOGISTICS INTERNATIONAL, INC. (OTCMKTS: UNQL) ("UNIQUE" OR THE "COMPANY"), A GLOBAL LOGISTICS AND FREIGHT FORWARDING COMPANY, TODAY\xa0ANNOUNCED\xa0A\xa012-MONTH\xa0OCEAN\xa0FREIGHT\xa0CONTRACT\xa0WITH\xa0THE KROGER COMPANY\xa0(NYSE:\xa0KR),\xa0A\xa0NEW CUSTOMER FOR THE COMPANY. UNDER THE TERMS OF THE AGREEMENT, THE COMPANY WILL SERVE AS AN OCEAN TRANSPORT AND LOGISTICS PROVIDER\xa0FOR\xa0THE KROGER COMPANY\xa0FROM\xa0THE\xa0ASIA-PACIFIC\xa0REGION\xa0TO\xa0NORTH\xa0AMERICA\xa0THROUGH APRIL 2023.'}{'symbol': 'KR', 'date': '2022-06-16 08:00:00', 'title': 'KROGER REPORTS FIRST QUARTER 2022 RESULTS AND RAISES FULL-YEAR GUIDANCE', 'text': 'FIRST QUARTER HIGHLIGHTS IDENTICAL SALES WITHOUT FUEL INCREASED 4.1% OPERATING PROFIT OF $1,505 MILLION; ADJUSTED FIFO OPERATING PROFIT OF $1,601 MILLION EPS OF $0.90; ADJUSTED EPS OF $1.45 COMPANY IS WIDENING ITS COMPETITIVE MOATS TO DELIVER VALUE FOR CUSTOMERS FRESH DEPARTMENT IDENTICAL SALES INCREASED 5.2% OUR BRANDS IDENTICAL SALES INCREASED 6.3% DIGITALLY ENGAGED HOUSEHOLDS GREW BY MORE THAN HALF A MILLION AND DIGITAL COUPON DOWNLOADS INCREASED 11% CINCINNATI , JUNE 16, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE KROGER CO. (NYSE: KR) TODAY REPORTED ITS FIRST QUARTER 2022 RESULTS AND WILL UPDATE INVESTORS ON HOW LEADING WITH FRESH AND ACCELERATING WITH DIGITAL INITIATIVES CONTINUE TO POSITION KROGER FOR LONG-TERM SUSTAINABLE GROWTH. COMMENTS FROM CHAIRMAN AND CEO RODNEY MCMULLEN "KROGER ACHIEVED STRONG FIRST QUARTER RESULTS AS WE SUCCESSFULLY EXECUTED ON OUR STRATEGY OF LEADING WITH FRESH AND ACCELERATING WITH DIGITAL.'}